,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98758","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98758.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98758.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-10T18:19:42Z"},"body":"Fixes #98756\r\n\r\nThe issue was caused by an inverse matrix operation (`p_cam_projection.inverse()`) failing due to a determinant evaluating to 0 under certain circumstances. The underlying implementation uses `Math::is_zero_approx()`, which checks for values less than `1e-5`. Using `1e-7` also fixed the issue but could have unintended consequences, as both inverse() and is_zero_approx() are used throughout the codebase. For reference, a previous discussion can be found at #58507.\r\n\r\nThe provided solution sidesteps this issue by simplifying the math to avoid using the inverse operation altogether.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98758/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,